4. **Theorem LD* for (a‴_k) [proved]** (§5): E[N(N−1)] ≤ (log N)^{O(1)}·S⁴ρ_r²ρ_F². With FM,
   PC ≤ (log N)^{O(1)}, so D_k(γ) holds with γ ≥ L^{−o(1)}.
